---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description: "Isabelle Seah",
	title: "About Me",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<h1 class="title mb-6">About</h1>
	<div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus max-w-none">
		<p>
			I'm a smart contract and full-stack developer with a unique blend of technical expertise and
			business acumen.
		</p>
		<p>
			My journey from business and sales into web3 development has given me a deep understanding of
			both user needs and technical constrants, giving me a multifaceted perspective of building
			what users actually want and need.
		</p>
		<p>
			What started as curiousity about crypto in 2021 led me to completely pivot careers, earning a
			Graduate Diploma in Systems Analysis at NUS and diving into smart contract development. But
			the more I built, the more I realized that great products aren't just about cool tech, they're
			about solving real problems while ensuring security, privacy, and user trust.
		</p>
		<p>
			Now I'm particularly interested in privacy-preserving technologies and how we can build
			products that protect users without sacrificing functionality. Whether it's Web3 security,
			smart contract architecture, or emerging privacy tech, I'm fascinated by the intersection of
			technical possibility and user experience.
		</p>
		<p>If you're interested in discussing ideas or collaborating, feel free to reach out!</p>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
